4. Understand the Tooling, Not Just the Code
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A lot of learners can write React components but have no idea how their project actually runs. That gap shows up in interviews and slows you down on real teams.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Things worth understanding:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
